### ============================================================================
### File: docs/api-tests/01-users.http
### Purpose: Manual and automated HTTP requests for Module 1 (Auth & Users)
### Compatible with: VS Code REST Client, Thunder Client, and IntelliJ HTTP Client
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@adminEmail = admin@mygodown.com
@adminPassword = AdminPassword123!
@managerEmail = manager@mygodown.com
@managerPassword = ManagerPassword123!
@staffEmail = staff@mygodown.com
@staffPassword = StaffPassword123!

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. [UC-01] Admin Login (Happy Path)
### Expect: 200 OK, token in data.token, user details (no password_hash)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Store token from login response
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. [UC-01] Login Failure - Validation Error (Missing Password)
### Expect: 400 Bad Request, VALIDATION_ERROR code with field-level details
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name loginValidationFail
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "invalid-email-format"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. [UC-01] Login Failure - Invalid Credentials
### Expect: 401 Unauthorized, generic message "Invalid email or password"
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name loginInvalidCredentials
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "WrongPassword123!"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. [UC-01] Login Failure - Deactivated Account
### Expect: 401 Unauthorized, generic message "Invalid email or password"
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name loginDeactivatedUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "inactive@test.com",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. [UC-02] Get Current User Profile (Happy Path)
### Expect: 200 OK, returns user object of current token holder
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getMe
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. [UC-02] Get Current User Profile - Unauthenticated
### Expect: 401 Unauthorized, UNAUTHORIZED code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getMeUnauthenticated
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. [UC-03] Change Own Password (Happy Path)
### Expect: 200 OK, success message
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name changePassword
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "{{adminPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "NewAdmin@123"
}

### Revert password back so subsequent test runs work cleanly
# @name revertPassword
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "NewAdmin@123",
  "newPassword": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. [UC-04] Create User (Admin Only - Happy Path)
### Expect: 201 Created, returns created user object without password
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Logistics",
  "email": "jane.logistics@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "role": "staff"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. [UC-04] Create User - Duplicate Email Conflict
### Expect: 409 Conflict, CONFLICT code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createUserDuplicateEmail
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Another Jane",
  "email": "jane.logistics@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "role": "staff"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 10. Manager Login for Permission Checks
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name managerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{managerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{managerPassword}}"
}

@managerToken = {{managerLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 11. [UC-04] Create User - Forbidden (Manager Trying to Create User)
### Expect: 403 Forbidden, FORBIDDEN code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createUserForbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Unauthorized User",
  "email": "unauth@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "role": "staff"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 12. [UC-05] List Users (Admin Access - Happy Path)
### Expect: 200 OK, paginated list of users and meta
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name listUsers
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=1&limit=10&role=staff
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 13. [UC-05] List Users - Forbidden for Manager (Admin Only Route)
### Expect: 403 Forbidden, FORBIDDEN code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name listUsersManagerForbidden
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 14. [UC-05] Get User by ID (Admin Access)
### Expect: 200 OK, user details
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getUserById
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 15. [UC-05] Get User by ID - Forbidden for Manager
### Expect: 403 Forbidden, FORBIDDEN code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getUserByIdManagerForbidden
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 16. [UC-05] Get User by ID - 404 Unknown User
### Expect: 404 Not Found, NOT_FOUND code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getUserByIdNotFound
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 17. [UC-06] Update User (Admin Only - Happy Path)
### Expect: 200 OK, updated user details
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name updateUser
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/3
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Staff Name",
  "role": "staff",
  "isActive": true
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 18. [UC-06] Reactivate User (Admin Setting isActive: true)
### Expect: 200 OK, user marked with isActive = true
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name reactivateUser
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/4
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "isActive": true
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 19. [UC-06] Admin Self-Deactivation Block
### Expect: 403 Forbidden ("Administrators cannot deactivate their own account")
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name selfDeactivationBlock
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 20. [UC-06] Admin Self-Demotion Block
### Expect: 403 Forbidden ("Administrators cannot demote their own role")
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name selfDemotionBlock
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "role": "manager"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 21. [UC-06] Last Active Admin Deactivation Block (DELETE /api/users/1)
### Expect: 403 Forbidden ("Administrators cannot deactivate their own account" or "Cannot deactivate last admin")
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name lastAdminDeactivationBlock
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 22. [UC-P02] Admin Reset Another User Password (Happy Path)
### Expect: 200 OK, "Password reset successfully"
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name adminResetUserPassword
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/3/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "password": "NewStaffPassword@123"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 23. [UC-P02] Admin Reset User Password - Weak Password (Validation Error)
### Expect: 400 Bad Request, VALIDATION_ERROR code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name adminResetUserPasswordWeak
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/3/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "password": "short"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 24. [UC-P02] Admin Reset User Password - Forbidden for Staff/Manager
### Expect: 403 Forbidden, FORBIDDEN code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name adminResetUserPasswordForbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/3/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "password": "ValidPassword@123"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 25. [UC-06] Soft-Deactivate User (Admin Only)
### Expect: 200 OK, user marked with is_active = 0
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name deactivateUser
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/3
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 26. Deactivated User Token Rejected on Protected Route
### Login as user 3 with updated password before deactivation, then verify rejection
### Expect: 401 Unauthorized ("User account has been deactivated")
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name verifyDeactivatedUserTokenRejected
GET {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: application/json
